# Vinca Web Application — Environment Configuration
#
# Production / Staging deployment:
# Set VITE_RELAY_URL to your deployed chain-relay HTTPS endpoint.
# When left unset or unreachable, the client operates in offline demo mode.
#
# Note: Vinca never connects to mainnet. The relay must point to a testnet or regtest lightwalletd.
VITE_RELAY_URL=https://relay-testnet.vinca.dev
